<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-041" chapter-id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage" source-id="s-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage-ws1552313">
  <p id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">始安貞王<persName id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p001:m0004" ref="98q_mll_d6v">道生</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p001:m0007" ref="98q_mll_d6v">孝伯</persName>，高帝次兄也。仕宋位奉朝請，卒。高帝即位，追加封諡。三子：長<persName id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p001:m0039" ref="98q_mll_d6v_A">鳳</persName>；次<persName id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p001:m0042" ref="w4m_9tw_147">鸞</persName>，是為明帝；次<persName id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p001:m0050" ref="98q_mll_d6v_B">沔</persName>，是為安陸昭王。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">每臨<persName id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p002:m0002" ref="98q_mll_d6v_B">沔</persName>靈，輒慟絕，哭不成聲。建武元年，贈司徒、安陸王。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-nanshi-041-bao-zhi-lineage:p003:m0001" ref="98q_mll_d6v_BA">寶晊</persName>嗣，永元元年，改封湘東王。</p>
</text>
